{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr Wolf is up to no good and Lil Red might be in trouble! But things aren't always what they seem with the residents of Townsvilleland. Now it's up to Captain Corgi to investigate this island planet and figure out what's really going on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131700/extras/9b2d593e61adb5f4d27f7c158eb6844a.poster.avif?t=1756516346\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131700/extras/9b2d593e61adb5f4d27f7c158eb6844a.webm?t=1756516346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131700/extras/9b2d593e61adb5f4d27f7c158eb6844a.mp4?t=1756516346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a short, lighthearted, narrative adventure game with some puzzle solving and a few minigames mixed in.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather info from the townsfolk, swap items and sail through space with Corgi and his brother Lem on their quest to become professional problem solvers! Or at least that's Corgi's quest. Lem is kind of just along for the ride because their mom told him to &quot;Look after your little brother&quot;. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About a two hour long adventure</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Chill exploration at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Quirky animal characters to chat with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    A 'bark' button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tItems to collect and secrets to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Space sailing!</p></li></u